# The Dockerfile does `COPY . /var/www/html`, so anything here would be baked into a
# published image. A developer's .env would be both a secret leak and a build-
# reproducibility hazard: Vite reads .env at build time, so a local one silently
# changes what gets compiled into the public JS bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
node_modules
vendor
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
tests
*.md
